{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/11/2026CAxN2VGXLZ1794297491.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/><p>股評人黃敏碩於節目中推介國泰航空(0293)，指公司受惠「客貨雙輪驅動、洲際競爭格局重構」，票價定價權強、旗下香港快運預料將扭虧。</p><p></p><p><p><img alt=\"2323.jpg\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/11/2026q68SG2BT011794297510.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/></p></p><p></p><p>黃敏碩建議現價即15.64元買入，目標價上望16.89元，若失守14.08元便止蝕。</p><p></p><p><p><img alt=\"2324.jpg\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/11/2026qJUym8vIXI1794297537.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/></p></p><p></p><p>國泰航空(0293)投資策略</p><p>買入　現價</p><p>目標　$16.89</p><p>止蝕　$14.08</p><p></p><p>股評人伍禮賢推介華虹宏力(1347)，指公司上季收入按年按季均錄得增長，毛利率擴闊，華力微收購完成後，12英吋收入比例升至70%，料今季業績繼續改善。</p><p></p><p><p><img alt=\"2325.jpg\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/11/2026qWOTSgJoMI1794297563.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/></p></p><p></p><p>伍禮賢認為現價、即74.65元即可買入，目標價82元，止蝕價訂於67元。</p><p></p><p><p><img alt=\"2326.jpg\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/11/2026SkaZmctGVn1794297585.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/></p></p><p></p><p>華虹宏力(1347)投資策略</p><p>買入　現價</p><p>目標　$82</p><p>止蝕　$67</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-10T13:00:47.676174+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":297,"images":5,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-10T07:57:00+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-10T13:14:29.798143+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-10T12:54:17.607211+00:00","content_hash":"34c857a10fb0734e1fd49c612cf08e881898bc7e9054e8347591f107202c3649","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":{"scraped_at":"2026-11-10T13:00:47.676174+00:00","latest_fallback":"rss-budget","latest_error":null},"content_capture":null}